ontent","notes":"All in all, this is the strongest and best-tasting Nitraflex Burn yet!"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Physiological basis: \"Reactive hyperemia\" describes the increase in muscle blood flow that occurs during high-intensity resistance exercise and produces the \"pump\" associated with increases in muscle size."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The Nitraflex pre-training formula contains ingredients that in animal, in vitro and clinical studies suggest possess properties that may help advanced athletes maximize energy, intensity, vascularity and reactive hyperemia (pumps) during their workouts, and provide long-term support of Nitric Oxide levels in the body when used as directed.\r\nUnique properties of some of the key compounds in Nitraflex Burn:\r\nPowered by Nitrosigine: This new formula boasts Nitrosigine as its only source of Arginine. Nitrosigine has been shown to inhibit the enzyme responsible for breaking down Arginine, making it the superior choice of arginine supplementation. Nitrosigine has scientifically validated that benefits last up to 6 hours after dosing. In addition to vasodilation (pump) and overall performance-enhancing benefits, Nitrosigine is clinically shown to increase mental focus, making it a truly well-rounded and multi-faceted addition to any effective pre-workout formula."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For maximum results:\r\nStack Nitraflex Burn with Flexx EAAs\r\nAim to stay on a workout regimen consisting of both weights and cardiovascular training\r\nEat 4-5 smaller meals throughout the day\r\nEliminate fast food and other high saturated fat and high sugar foods from diet\r\nStay hydrated by drinking adequate water throughout the day"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"#CompeteHarder with GAT Nitraflex Burn!"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Note: One serving contains 325 mg caffeine, 1,000 mg Nitrosigine"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if neck seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Made in the United States with domestic and foreign ingredients"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warning: This product is strictly intended for use by healthy persons 18 years of age or older."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Each serving (1 scoop) contains 325 mg of caffeine. Do not combine with other caffeine or stimulant-containing products."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Do not use if you are pregnant, nursing or trying to become pregnant."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if you are currently unaware of your health status or if you have a medical condition including but not limited to heart, liver, kidney, or thyroid disease, psychiatric or epileptic disorders, high or low blood pressure, cardiac arrhythmia, recurrent headaches, enlarged prostate or glaucoma."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Do not use if you are taking prescription or non-prescription medication of any kind including but not limited to MAO inhibitors, anti-depressants, aspirin or non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if you are prone to overheating or dehydration. After 8 weeks of use, take 1 week off before resuming use. Discontinue use at least 2 weeks prior to surgery or if you experience rapid heartbeat, dizziness, severe headache or shortness of breath."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of the reach of children."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Copyright 2022 GAT/World Health Products LLC. All world rights reserved. NITRAFLEX BURN is a registered trademark of World Health Products LLC. The GAT logo is stylized GAT Sport \"Peak\" symbol are trademarks or registered trademarks by 